msgid "Managed by %s"
msgstr "Gjestît di %s"

msgid "Shut down"
msgstr "Distude"

msgid "Browse as Guest"
msgstr "Navighe come ospit"

msgid "Apps"
msgstr "Aplicazions"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Anule"

msgid "Retry"
msgstr "Torne prove"

msgid "Opening the sign-in page…"
msgstr "O si sta vierzint la pagjine di acès…"

msgid "The sign-in page could not be opened."
msgstr "No si à rivât a vierzi la pagjine di acès."

msgid "Cannot reach the school. Connect to Wi-Fi from the top bar, then retry."
msgstr "No si rive a contatâ la scuele. Conetiti a une rêt Wi-Fi de sbare parsore e torne prove."

msgid "IT maintenance sign-in"
msgstr "Jentrade pe manutenzion informatiche"

msgid "Username"
msgstr "Non utent"

msgid "This account cannot sign in on this computer."
msgstr "Chest account nol pues jentrâ su chest computer."

msgid "This account cannot sign in on this computer. Use your school email (%s)."
msgstr "Chest account nol pues jentrâ su chest computer. Dopre la tô pueste eletroniche di scuele (%s)."

msgid "You signed in with a different account. Sign in again with the account you chose here."
msgstr "Tu às fat l'acès cuntun altri account. Torne a jentrâ cul account che tu âs sielt achì."

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Lenghe"

msgid "Keyboard"
msgstr "Tastiere"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Va indenant"

msgid "The setting could not be saved. Try again."
msgstr "No si à rivât a salvâ la impostazion. Torne prove."

msgid "Your account is disabled. Contact your administrator."
msgstr "Il tô account al è disativât. Contate il to aministradôr."

msgid "This device is disabled. Contact your administrator."
msgstr "Chest dispositîf al è disativât. Contate il to aministradôr."

msgid "Sign in with your school account."
msgstr "Jentre cul to account di scuele."

msgid "Could not sign in. Please try again."
msgstr "No si à rivât a jentrâ. Torne prove."

msgid "Authentication request cancelled"
msgstr "Richieste di autenticazion anulade"

msgid "Maximum number of authentication attempts reached"
msgstr "Si è rivâts al numar massim di tentatîfs di autenticazion"

msgid "Error retrieving access token. Please try again."
msgstr "Erôr tal otignî il token di acès. Torne prove."

msgid "Invalid user name"
msgstr "Non utent no valit"

msgid "This computer has been locked by the school; please contact IT"
msgstr "Chest computer al è stât blocât de scuele; contate il IT"

msgid "Guest sign-in is not allowed on this computer"
msgstr "Su chest computer no si pues jentrâ come ospit"

msgid "Local accounts cannot sign in on this computer"
msgstr "I account locâi no puedin jentrâ su chest computer"

msgid "School accounts cannot sign in on this computer"
msgstr "I account di scuele no puedin jentrâ su chest computer"

msgid "This app can only be opened from the sign-in screen"
msgstr "Cheste aplicazion si pues vierzi dome de schermade di acès"

msgid "This app needs a network. Connect to Wi-Fi from the top bar, then retry."
msgstr "Cheste aplicazion e à bisugne di une rêt. Conetiti a une rêt Wi-Fi de sbare parsore e torne prove."

msgid "No network. Connect to Wi-Fi from the top-right menu."
msgstr "Nissune rêt. Conetiti a une rêt Wi-Fi dal menù in alt a diestre."

msgid "Waiting for school settings."
msgstr "In spiete des impostazions de scuele."

msgid "Installing the web browser. You can sign in; it will appear when ready."
msgstr "Daûr a instalâ il navigadôr web. Tu puedis jentrâ; al comparirà cuant che al sarà pront."

msgid "The web browser could not be installed yet; it will try again. You can sign in."
msgstr "Nol è stât pussibil instalâ il navigadôr web par cumò; si tornarà a provâ. Tu puedis jentrâ."

msgid "Name or school email"
msgstr "Non o pueste eletroniche de scuele"

msgid "Keep typing to narrow down"
msgstr "Continue a scrivi par strenzi la liste"
